translation.billing.costBreakdown.description	Share of this organization's model and cloud compute cost over the last {{days}} days.
translation.billing.costBreakdown.skills	Skills
translation.billing.costBreakdown.skillsInfo	Skills aren't always in context. Until a skill is used, a session carries at most its name and description, so you pay for its full instructions only in sessions that use it.\
If this share looks high, check Customizations for your most-used skills, then shorten long ones or make their descriptions more specific so they load only when needed.
translation.billing.costBreakdown.skillsInfoLabel	About the cost of skills
translation.billing.costBreakdown.skillsInfoLink	Manage skills
translation.billing.costBreakdown.rules	Rules
translation.billing.costBreakdown.rulesInfo	Always-on rules load in every session they apply to, such as a repo's root AGENTS.md in sessions using that repo, so you pay for them even when the task doesn't need them. Nested AGENTS.md files and rules with path patterns load only when a session touches a matching path.\
If this share looks high, shorten your always-on rules and move guidance for one part of a repo into a nested AGENTS.md or a rule with a path pattern, so it loads only when needed.
translation.billing.costBreakdown.rulesInfoLabel	About the cost of rules
translation.billing.costBreakdown.rulesInfoLink	Manage rules
translation.billing.costBreakdown.connectedMcps	Connected MCPs
translation.billing.costBreakdown.connectedMcpsInfo	Connected MCPs are servers you chose to add, not Devin's built-in tools. You pay to list them in a session's context, and each time Devin calls one of their tools and reads the result.\
If this share looks high, remove servers your team doesn't use.
translation.billing.costBreakdown.connectedMcpsInfoLabel	About the cost of connected MCPs
translation.billing.costBreakdown.connectedMcpsInfoLink	Manage MCPs
translation.billing.costBreakdown.ciChecks	CI checks
translation.billing.costBreakdown.ciChecksInfo	What you pay for Devin to check CI status and read CI logs after a session opens its first pull request, including cloud compute while those checks run.\
If this share looks high, speed up slow CI and fix flaky checks so Devin spends less time waiting on them.
translation.billing.costBreakdown.ciChecksInfoLabel	About the cost of CI checks
translation.billing.costBreakdown.ciChecksInfoLink	Manage CI follow-up
translation.billing.costBreakdown.noData	No cost data for this period.
translation.billing.costBreakdown.loadError	Couldn't load the cost breakdown.
translation.billing.costBreakdown.vmLlmTitle	Cloud compute and model cost
translation.billing.costBreakdown.vmLlmDescription	Share of this organization's cost over the last {{days}} days.
translation.billing.costBreakdown.vmLlmInfo	The cost of cloud compute depends on the machine your sessions run on and how long they run.\
If the cloud compute share looks high, speed up slow builds and tests so sessions finish sooner, and choose a smaller machine when you don't need the capacity.
translation.billing.costBreakdown.vmLlmInfoLabel	About cloud compute and model cost
translation.billing.costBreakdown.vmLlmInfoLink	Manage machines
translation.billing.costBreakdown.vm	Cloud compute
translation.billing.costBreakdown.llm	Model
